+*   **Free Space Learning:** If only predicted samples are used, the sampling network may never learn geometry in unsampled regions (free space) [S1]. Adding equidistant samples ensures density values are acquired for these regions [S1].
 *   **False Positives:** A false-positive sampling network misprediction (predicting a sample in free space) poses no issue for the color network, as the density will be low [S1].
 
